              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "P"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Only change was the bacon. I used a pack of the Oscar Mayer Bacon Pieces instead of frying my own bacon and making the mess. It also makes a nice freezer meal. Potatoes and carrots freeze well raw. I have made this 5-6 times in the last couple of years. Stick to your ribs, great, great stew!",
